# Gameplay reproduction for inc-p0h1 (Bestow Curse redesign), the RANDOM
# (no player-choice) code path -- what master runs unconditionally, and what
# the branch runs for every non-player caster.
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/bestow-curse-random.keys 1
#
# Priest, not the usual barbarian: Bestow Curse is a Priest spell, and a
# player must actually cast one to see how the game shows the curse. Wizard
# mode supplies the spell and the target, following the pattern already
# proven in tools/keys/sanctuary-strike.keys and tools/keys/lof-magic-missile.keys:
#   * "Learn Any Spell" grants Bestow Curse as an innate spell (SP_KNOWN|
#     SP_PRIMAL|SP_INNATE, src/Debug.cpp:862), so no character level or
#     mana-pool arithmetic stands between chargen and the cast.
#   * "Monster Summoning" places a goblin one square in the named direction,
#     a sapient (MA_SAPIENT) target the spell's own Flags: EF_LIM_MTYPE
#     requires.
#   * "@while "more --" SPACE" after ENTER, exactly as lof-magic-missile.keys
#     does: the cast's own messages can outrun the message window, and the
#     game pages with a "-- more --" prompt that swallows the next scripted
#     key if it is not cleared first.
#
# A fresh goblin per cast, not one goblin re-cast, because
# Creature::Invoke's own already-has-this-effect refusal (src/Magic.cpp
# ~4838, "a second invocation would have no effect") fires on ANY second
# successful landing against the SAME victim, so a repeat cast cannot be
# trusted to show a second, independent random(8) roll.

@include chargen-priest.keys
ESC

w
y
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN*10
SPACE
ESC

w
@choose "Learn Any Spell"
"Bestow Curse"
ENTER

w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin"
RIGHT ENTER
@dump:goblin-1-summoned

m
@choose "Bestow Curse"
RIGHT
ENTER
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:cast-1

w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin"
UP ENTER
@dump:goblin-2-summoned

m
@choose "Bestow Curse"
UP
ENTER
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:cast-2

w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin"
DOWN ENTER
@dump:goblin-3-summoned

m
@choose "Bestow Curse"
DOWN
ENTER
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:cast-3

w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin"
HOME ENTER
@dump:goblin-4-summoned

m
@choose "Bestow Curse"
HOME
ENTER
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:cast-4

@quit
